苍月草幼时在人类身边担任助手，后来成为鼠族图书馆的管理员。她能记住书架的位置、访客借走的册数，甚至某封旧信上被划掉的日期。一次整理归还记录时，她发现几名失踪者曾借阅过同一本不起眼的旅行手册。她将线索送交Seven协会，从此由保存记录的人变成了追索记录的人。

她的记忆很好，休息却很差。已经确认过的细节也会让她在夜里起身再核对一遍，桌上的浓茶往往凉了才被想起。任务结束后，她习惯将零散笔记重新誊写，直到每个人名、每处地点都有能够相互印证的出处。

Hana协会确认其派遣资料。苍月草愿意协助殖民地整理研究与调查工作；请给她一张安静的桌子，以及能够按时收工的理由。</detailedReport><pawnKind>TRK_Special_CangYueCao</pawnKind><association>七协会 · 南部Seven协会</association><iconPath>SpecialCharacter/CangYueCao</iconPath><price>2000</price><firstName>苍月草</firstName><nickname>苍月草</nickname><lastName /><biologicalAge>22</biologicalAge><gender>Female</gender><bodyType>Thin</bodyType><headType>RK_HeadType_Head4</headType><hair>RK_sidePonyA</hair><hairColor>(0.149,0.149,0.149,1.000)</hairColor><hairColorSecond>(1.000,1.000,1.000,1.000)</hairColorSecond><favoriteColor>Structure_Green</favoriteColor><facialAnimation><head>Ratkin_Head</head><eyes>Ratkin_EyeGuruGuru</eyes><lids>Ratkin_LidPointy</lids><brows>Ratkin_BrowCool</brows><mouth>Ratkin_MouthNormal</mouth><skin>Ratkin_SkinNormal</skin><eyeColor>(0.004,0.420,0.718,1.000)</eyeColor><eyeColorSecond>(0.004,0.420,0.718,1.000)</eyeColorSecond></facialAnimation><addonVariants><li>0</li><li>0</li><li>0</li></addonVariants><xenotype>RK_XenoType_Ratkin</xenotype><endogenes><li>Skin_Melanin1</li><li>RK_Gene_SmallBody</li><li>RK_Gene_Nimble</li><li>RK_Gene_PoorEyesight</li><li>RK_Gene_FragilePain</li><li>RK_Gene_GoodGardening</li><li>Skin_SheerWhite</li><li>Beard_NoBeardOnly</li><li>RK_Gene_LargeEars</li><li>RK_Gene_ThinTail</li><li>RK_Gene_CuteFace</li><li>AptitudeStrong_Mining</li><li>AptitudeStrong_Plants</li><li>Hair_ReddishBrown</li></endogenes><skills><li><skill>Shooting</skill><level>5</level><passion>Minor</passion></li><li><skill>Melee</skill><level>7</level><passion>Minor</passion></li><li><skill>Construction</skill><level>0</level><passion>None</passion></li><li><skill>Mining</skill><level>4</level><passion>None</passion></li><li><skill>Cooking</skill><level>9</level><passion>Minor</passion></li><li><skill>Plants</skill><level>7</level><passion>None</passion></li><li><skill>Animals</skill><level>0</level><passion>None</passion></li><li><skill>Crafting</skill><level>2</level><passion>None</passion></li><li><skill>Artistic</skill><lev